#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Igama"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Nika le akhawunti igama elinencazelo elizovezwa."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi elizosetshenziselwa ukuqinisekisa ubuqotho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Iphasiwedi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Iphasiwedi esetshenziselwa ukuqinisekisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Nika amandla Iphasiwedi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Iphasiwedi yakho ye-Enable, uma idingeka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Nika Amandla Idivayisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Susa ukumaka leli bhokisi ukuze ukhubaze le divayisi ekwenziweni ikhophi yasenqolobaneni."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Incazelo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Igama lale divayisi (lizosetshenziselwa ukulondoloza ukulungiselelwa kanye ne-SVN uma kungekho gama lomsingathi ekulungiselelweni)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Ikheli le-IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Leli yikheli le-IP elisetshenziswa ukuxhumana nedivayisi."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Iseva ye-TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Iseva ye-TFTP ongayikhetha le divayisi ekopisha kuyo ukulungiselelwa kwayo. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise isilungiselelo se-TFTP Server somhlaba wonke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Ukhiye Womsingathi We-SSH Olondoloziwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Qhathanisa le algorithm yokhiye womsingathi kanye ne-SHA-1 hex fingerprint nedivayisi ngokusebenzisa ishaneli ethembekile. Kuseva, buyisela umzila ongezansi ngefayela lokhiye womsingathi womphakathi elifanayo bese usebenzisa: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Sebenzisa isenzo sedivayisi ukuze uyisule ngemva koshintsho lokhiye olusemthethweni."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Uhla lwemibhalo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Lesi isakhiwo sohlu lwezinkomba esihlobene esisetshenziselwa ukugcina izilungiselelo."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo Lohlelo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Kufanele yenziwe kangaki ikhophi yasenqolobaneni yale divayisi. Okwansuku zonke okune-Phinda Njalo ngo-10 kwenza ikhophi yasenqolobaneni njalo ezinsukwini eziyi-10; Okwenyanga kwenza ikhophi yasenqolobaneni yenyanga yekhalenda yangempela."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Phinda Uqhube Njalo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Kumashejuli Ansuku Zonke, phinda usebenzise ikhophi eyisipele njalo ezinsukwini ezingu-X. Kumashejuli Amaviki Onke angenazo Izinsuku Zeviki eziqondile, yiphinde njalo emavikini angu-X; uma Izinsuku Zeviki sezikhethiwe, ikhophi eyisipele isebenza ngalezo zinsuku njalo ngeviki futhi le nkambu ayisebenzi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Izinsuku Zeviki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Kwishejuli Yeviki, izinsuku zeviki okuzosetshenziswa ngazo ikhophi eyisipele, njalo ngeviki. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze kusebenze njalo emavikini e-Rerun Every esikhundleni salokho."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Izinyanga Zonyaka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kwishejuli Yenyanga, izinyanga zonyaka okuzosetshenziswa kuzo ikhophi eyisipele."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Izinsuku Zenyanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Kwishejuli Yenyanga, izinsuku zenyanga okuzosetshenziswa ngazo ikhophi eyisipele (Last = usuku lokugcina lwenyanga)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Amaviki Enyanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kwishejuli Yenyanga Ngosuku, amaviki enyanga okuzosetshenziswa kuwo ikhophi eyisipele."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Izinsuku Zeviki (Nyanga Zonke)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Kwishejuli Yenyanga Ngosuku, izinsuku zesonto zokuhambisana nokukhethwa Kwamaviki Enyanga."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Device Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo Lwedivayisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose the type of device that the router is."
msgstr "Khetha uhlobo lwedivayisi eyilo i-router."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "Auto-Detect"
msgstr "Thola Ngokuzenzakalelayo"

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Connection Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo Lokuxhumana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Lolu uhlobo loxhumo olusetshenziselwa ukuxhumana nedivayisi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Authentication Account"
msgstr "I-akhawunti Yokuqinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Choose an account to use to Login to the router"
msgstr "Khetha i-akhawunti ozoyisebenzisa ukuze Ungene ku-router"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Akukho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default timeout"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuphela esizenzakalelayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to wait in seconds for a response"
msgstr "Isikhathi esizenzakalelayo sokulinda impendulo ngemizuzwana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default sleep time"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokulala esizenzakalelayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default time to sleep in microseconds (1/1,000,000th of a second)"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokulala esizenzakalelayo ngamamayikrosekhendi (1/1,000,000 yomzuzwana)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume elevated"
msgstr "Thatha njengokuphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box to assume this device is always elevated"
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi ukuze ucabange ukuthi le divayisi ihlala inamalungelo aphezulu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device type."
msgstr "Igama lalolu hlobo lwedivayisi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Username Prompt"
msgstr "Umyalelo Wegama Lomsebenzisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the username prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Lesi isicelo segama lomsebenzisi okufanele sifaniswe lapho ungena ngemvume."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password Prompt"
msgstr "Umyalelo Wephasiwedi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the password prompt to match on login."
msgstr "Lesi isicelo sephasiwedi okufanele sifaniswe lapho ungena ngemvume."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Ifayela lokumisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Lena indawo ejwayelekile yefayela lokulungiselela kudivayisi ekude. Isetshenziselwa indlela ye-SCP ne-SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Kopisha i-TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Lona umbhalo we-CLI osetshenziselwa ukuthumela isipele kuseva ye-tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Umyalo Wokuthwebula"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Umyalo ongakukhetha okukhipha kwawo kulondolozwa njengokulungiselelwa, esikhundleni sokukukopishela kuseva ye-TFTP. Uhlala usebenza nge-SSH, noma ngabe yiluphi Uhlobo Lokuxhuma, futhi idivayisi ayisadingi iseva ye-TFTP. Shiya kungenalutho kumadivayisi akopisha ukulungiselelwa kwawo ku-TFTP. Isibonelo se-MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Bonisa Inguqulo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Lona umbhalo we-CLI osetshenziselwa ukubonisa inguqulo yamanje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Umbuzo Wokuqinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Lona ngumyalo wokuqinisekisa okufanele uhambisane nawo ngaphambi kokudlulisela."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Qinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Ingabe kukhona umyalo wokuqinisekisa ukukopisha ukumiswa?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Phoqa Ukuqinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Ingabe kukhona umyalo wokuqinisekisa ngempoqo ukukopisha ukumiswa?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Hlola i-End ku-Config"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Hlola i-end ku-config?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Umkhombandlela Wanoma Yimuphi Ukhiye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Umbhalo ozohambisana nesikhombi esisesitayeleni esithi 'Cindezela Noma Imuphi Ukhiye Ukuze Uqhubeke'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Imiyalo Yangemva Kokungena"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Amapheya okucela/impendulo ongawakhetha athunyelwa ngokushesha ngemva kokungena, ngaphambi komyalo wokukopishela ku-TFTP, elilodwa kulayini ngamunye njenge-prompt|response. Isicelo sifaniswa njengenkulumo evamile engahlukanisi usayizi wezinhlamvu ngokumelene nokukhipha kwedivayisi (ngakho-ke angeke liqukathe i-| ngokwalo, futhi abakaki nezinye izinhlamvu ezikhethekile kufanele kuphunywe kuzo, isib. Save \\[y/n\\]), futhi impendulo ithunyelwa njengoba ibhaliwe, noma sebenzisa u-<CR> ukuze uthumele ukubuyisela kwenqola kuphela. Impendulo ithunyelwa kuphela uma isicelo sayo sesiboniwe, kungaba sempendulweni yesicelo sangaphambilini noma kokukhipha kwakamuva; kungenjalo kubhalwa isexwayiso futhi akukho okuthunyelwayo. Lezi ziphendulwa kuqala; isicelo se-Any Key esingenhla siphendulwa kamuva, ngenkathi idivayisi inikwa amandla, ngakho-ke isicelo esiphendulwe lapha asisoze safika ku-Any Key. Isibonelo: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Ezivamile"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Imodi Yokwethula"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Ingabe Izilungiselelo Zerutha kufanele zivezwe kuKhonsoli noma kuThebhu Ephezulu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Ikhonsoli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Ithebhu Ephezulu"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Imigqa Yokuqukethwe Komehluko Wokumisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Inani elizenzakalelayo lemigqa engashintshiwe okufanele iboniswe ngaphambi nangemva kwenguquko ngayinye lapho kuqhathaniswa ama-backup amabili. Inani elikhulu lenza kube lula ukubona umongo wokulungiselela ozungezile. Lokhu kungaguqulwa ngokuqhathanisa ngakunye ekhasini lokuqhathanisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuxhumana siphelile"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu sokulinda ngamasekhondi lapho kusungulwa uxhumano lokuqala lwenethiwekhi kudivayisi. Idivayisi ebambekile noma engafinyeleleki iyashiywa ngemva kwalesi sikhathi sokuphela ukuze ukwenziwa kwekhophi eyisipele okuhleliwe kuqhubeke namadivayisi asele."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Vala ngaphandle kokuphuma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, lapho kuvalwa uxhumano lwedivayisi, akukho myalo othi 'exit' okhishwayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Ibhafa Yokuxhumana Yokulungisa Amaphutha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Ukuthi kubhalwe umphumela oqondile wokuxhumeka kwedivayisi yini"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Thatha wonke amadivayisi njengaphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Ukuthi kuqagelwe ukuthi wonke amadivayisi anamalungelo aphakeme yini"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Ihora Lokulanda"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Ihora losuku lokwenza ukulanda okugcwele."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Uhlelo Lokuzama Futhi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokulinda ngaphambi kokuzama ukwenza ukulanda okwengeziwe uma ukulanda okuhleliwe kwehluleka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Isikhathi Sokugcina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Inani lezinsuku zokugcina amakhophi okulondoloza amadala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Gcina Amakhophi Asalondoloziwe Edivayisi Engasebenzi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, ukuhlanzwa kokugcina ngeke kususe amakhophi okulondoloza amadala angawamadivayisi akhutshaziwe noma amadivayisi asusiwe, ngakho izilungiselelo zamadivayisi angasasebenzi noma angafinyeleleki ziyagcinwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zokudlulisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lokuxhumana oluzenzakalelayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Uhlobo oluzenzakalelayo lokuxhumana olusetshenziselwa ukuxhumana nedivayisi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Hlukanisa Ngedivayisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Hlukanisa Izilungiselelo ezigciniwe zibe kufolda yedivayisi ngayinye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Ifolda Engaphansi Enosuku"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Faka uhla lwemibhalo oluncike osukwini endleleni yengobo yomlando (ngaphambi kwefolda yedivayisi ngayinye), ukuze ukusebenza ngakunye kugcinwe ngaphansi kosuku lwakho lwekhophi eyisipele, isib. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Ukuvala kugcina ukwakheka okukhona."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Indlela ye-SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
