#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Qinisekisa Izikhiye Zomsingathi ze-SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Rekhoda ukhiye womsingathi we-SSH wedivayisi ngayinye ekuxhumekeni kokuqala bese wenqaba ukuthumela izifakazo uma ushintsha kamuva. Imodi ye-SSH/Telnet ngeke ibuyele ku-Telnet ngenkathi ukuqinisekisa kunikwe amandla. Ngemva kokushintsha kokhiye okusemthethweni, sebenzisa isenzo sedivayisi ukuze usule ukhiye womsingathi ogciniwe."

