#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Faka Umehluko Wokulungiselelwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Engeza i-diff ehlanganisiwe yedivayisi ngayinye ekulungiselelwa kwayo okushintshile ngesikhathi sokusebenza ku-imeyili yesipele, ukuze umbuyekezi abone ncamashi okushintshile. Ukulungiselelwa okumbaxambili (okungesona umbhalo) kuyeqiwa. Imigqa eguquguqukayo eshintsha kusipele ngasinye (i-Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' ne-'Current configuration :', kanye ne-NX-OS '!Time:' ne-'!Running configuration last done at:') ihlala inganakwa. Isexwayiso: i-diff ithunyelwa njengombhalo ocacile kumamukeli ngamunye we-imeyili, ngakho ingadalula ukulungiselelwa okufanele kuhlale kuyimfihlo; shiya ukuthi Faka Izimfihlo ku-Diffs kungamakiwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Faka Izimfihlo Emehlukweni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Thumela amanani ayimfihlo ku-diff ethunyelwe nge-imeyili njengoba enjalo. Uma kungahloliwe (okuzenzakalelayo), imigqa eshintshiwe itholakala kuzilungiselelo ezingahluziwe bese iphrintwa ifihliwe, ihluleka ngokuvala: imigqa equkethe amagama afana nemfihlo (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) nemigqa yomsingathi nomsebenzisi we-SNMP incishiswa ibe yigama layo lokuqala elilandelwa ngu-&lt;secret hidden&gt;, futhi wonke umugqa webhulokhi ye-PEM, isitifiketi noma ibhulokhi yochungechunge lokhiye, noma inani elibhalwe phakathi kwezimpawu zokucaphuna emigqeni eminingi, nanoma yimuphi umugqa we-hex noma i-base64, kuyafihlwa; ibhulokhi engapheli ifihla konke okusele kwesilungiselelo. Lokhu kufihla nemigqa engenangozi (isib. incazelo ekhuluma ngokhiye), kodwa wonke umugqa oshintshiwe uyabonakala njalo, uphawulwe ngokuthi (changed) uma kwehluka ingxenye yawo efihliwe kuphela, futhi ibhulokhi engapheli iyaphawulwa ku-imeyili. Amabhakhaphu agciniwe awashintshwa neze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Amaphethini Okukhishwa Ku-Diff"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Izinkulumo ezivamile ongazikhetha (eyodwa kulayini ngamunye) ezifanisa imigqa yokulungiselela okufanele inganakwa uma kuqhathaniswa, ukuze imigqa eguquguqukayo efana nezitembu zesikhathi noma izinombolo zochungechunge ingaveli njengezinguquko. Iphethini ngayinye ifaniswa ngaphandle kokubheka usayizi wezinhlamvu noma kuphi emugqeni ngaphandle kokuba iboshwe ngo-^ noma u-$; iphethini engeyona inkulumo evamile esebenzayo ayinakwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
